@startuml
!include ../_fragments/style.puml
!include ../_fragments/legend.puml
!include ../_fragments/lifelines.puml


BP_STYLE()
BP_LIFELINES()
BP_LEGEND()


title Registry: resolveOrCreate immutable *params (M2)\n@version REG.v1
autonumber


Admin -> API: POST /api/params/{kind} {yaml/json}
API -> DB: canonicalize(JSON) & SELECT id FROM {kind}_params\nWHERE UNIQUE(type,timeframe_canonical,version,canonical_json)
alt exists
DB --> API: params_id
else not found
API -> DB: INSERT INTO {kind}_params (type, timeframe_canonical, version, canonical_json)
DB --> API: params_id (new)
end
API --> Admin: 201 Created {params_id}


== Использование потребителями ==
Scheduler -> Indicators: resolveOrCreate(indicator_params)
Indicators -> DB: SELECT/INSERT same canonical_json → params_id
Scheduler -> Signals: resolveOrCreate(signal_params)
Signals -> DB: SELECT/INSERT → params_id
Scheduler -> Quorum: resolveOrCreate(quorum_params)
Quorum -> DB: SELECT/INSERT → params_id
Admin -> API: POST /api/backtest/run {config}
API -> DB: resolveOrCreate(backtest_params) → params_id


note over API,DB
Канонизация JSON (стабильный порядок ключей, типы, без дефолтов).\n
Все *_params — append-only, UNIQUE(type,timeframe_canonical,version,canonical_json).
end note
@enduml